Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}三对三   那应该会很好玩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Get a little 3-on-3 going? Oh, that would be so much fun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我能玩吗  我从未玩过足球{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Can I play too?I've never played football, ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}太棒了  你可以防守钱德{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Great! You can cover Chandler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不想玩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't... I don't really want to play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.92,0:01:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你跟珍妮丝分手后什么事都没做{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You never do anything since you and Janice broke up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}才不是这样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想整天穿着睡袍啃花生{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I wanted to wear my bathrobe and eat peanut clusters all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:02:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}一早开始喝酒  别说我没有目标{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And start drinking in the morning. Don't say I don't have goals!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你得开始忘了她  好吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You have to start getting over her, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}玩球或许能让你忘记珍妮丝{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}If you play, maybe it'll take your mind off Janice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}如果你不玩  大家会生你的气  因为两队人数不一样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}If you don't, everyone will be mad at you because the teams won't be even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  我玩就是了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right, I'll play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}来玩吧  罗斯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yay! Yay! Let's do it! Ross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么  要玩足球吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What? Wanna play football?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗯...{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}摩妮卡跟我不能玩足球{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Monica and I aren't supposed to play football.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谁说的   你们妈妈说的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Says who? Your mom? Ha-ha-ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对 对{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}以前每年感恩节我们都会玩足球赛{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ahem. Every Thanksgiving, um, we used to have a touch football game...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}它就叫做盖勒杯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...called The Geller Bowl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  你得骄傲地说出来才行{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, no, no. You say that proudly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}总之我跟罗斯总是当队长{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Anyway, Ross and I were always captains, and, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}竞争很激烈  有一年  第六届盖勒杯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It got kind of competitive. And one year, Geller Bowl VI...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不小心打断罗斯的鼻子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...I accidentally broke Ross' nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.45,0:02:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你是故意的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It was so not an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她看到我就快抱住她  就用她的…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She saw I was about to tag her, so she threw...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}用她那老奶奶般的粗手臂打我的脸{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...her big fat grandma-arm elbow in my face...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}然后拼命往前跑{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and just kept running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对了  我达阵得分获得胜利{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}To score the winning touchdown, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哇啊  哦  啊  哦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Whoa, whoa, whoa! Heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你没赢  达阵得分不算{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh, you did not win the game. The touchdown didn't count...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为你犯规了  非常野蛮地打断了我的鼻子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...because of the spectacularly illegal, and savage, nose-breaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.72,0:03:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我赢了那场比赛{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I won the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是吗   为什么你没拿到盖勒杯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah? Then how come you didn't get the Geller Cup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还有盖勒杯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ahem, there was a Geller Cup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  赢的人可以拿到奖杯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes, the trophy you got if you won the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但爸说没有人赢   他讨厌我们打架{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But Dad said nobody won, and he was sick of our fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以他把奖杯拿走{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So he took the trophy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}丢进湖里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...threw it in the lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}诅咒破解了吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And was the curse lifted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}总之…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Anyway...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}妈说我们再也不准玩足球{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...Mom said we weren't allowed to play football again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你知道吗   我想我们能打一场比赛{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know what? I think we should play a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.30,0:03:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}少来了  那是十二年前的事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, come on. It's been 12 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们能谈一谈吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Can I see you for a second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wuss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  我们要玩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right, we're gonna play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等一下  我们怎么去球场   我妈不让我过街{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wait. How we gonna get there? My mom won't let me cross the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}来吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Here you go.{\r}
