Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.27,0:20:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们知道吗   这真的很好笑   终点在灯柱那边{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know? Funny thing, actually. The end zone starts at that pole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:20:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你少了五码  所以…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So you're five feet short. So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们赢了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...ha-ha-ha, we win! - Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}太棒了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes, yes, yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等一下  请解释一下{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wait, explain something, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}如果没有人扑倒瑞秋  比赛还在进行中吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}If nobody tagged Rachel, then isn't the play still going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}让我来   不行  放手{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Let me in! Let me in! No way! Let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}放手  我只是个小女孩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Let go? I'm a tiny little woman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.47,0:21:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}两位  好了  今天是感恩节{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Guys, come on, it's Thanksgiving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}输赢不重要{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's not important who wins or loses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}重点是那个荷兰女孩选了我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The important thing is the Dutch girl picked me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她选了我  不是你  荷兰爱钱德  谢谢阿姆斯特丹  晚安{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Me, not you! Holland loves Chandler! Thank you, Amsterdam! Good night!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哇{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.03,0:21:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们应该多抽空玩足球{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We should play football more often.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}或许我们可以加入联盟{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Maybe there's a league we could join.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不是有国家美式足球联盟吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Isn't there a "national football league"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没错  他们会在星期天跟星期一晚上比赛{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes, there is. They play on Sundays and Monday nights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}该死  星期一晚上我得上班{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, shoot! I work Monday nights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}馅料好好吃  你们觉得  我们该包一点给他们吃吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This stuffing is amazing. Do you think we should bring them some?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.26,0:22:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们饿了就会回家{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}When they're hungry, they'll come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}放手  不  你才要放手{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Let go! No, you let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.35,0:22:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么每次都是只剩 我们两个人抱着球不放{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How come it's always us left holding the ball?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道  我想其他人就是不在乎{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know. I guess the other people just don't care enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.07,0:22:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}下雪了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, it's starting to snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.21,0:22:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}球给我   放手  快点{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Give it to me! Let go! Let it go! Come on, let go!{\r}
